re. Bits now glow brighter the farther they travel from where they were born, so a big burst lights up as it spreads. Fixed: bits no longer vanish near the HUB before you've bought it. We've fixed a Firefox crash caused by music fading between tracks shortly after the tutorial started. Thank you to the player who reported it. All 11 languages a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T11:32:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041737","verified_at":"2026-10-25T16:28:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4985040-1847286114029464","game_id":"steam-4985040","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 5.1.8.4: the finale, fixed (and a second ending)","summary":"The Next Fest demo's finale just got polished. Here's what changed in 5.1.8.4: The surge hits right. When your reactor goes critical, bright bits now fountain out of the HUB instead of fading into tiny dark dots. A cleaner meltdown. The CRITICALITY card no longer hangs around under the Richter screen. The countdown sits lower and stays fully visible, start to finish. Phones: the meltdown score and text aren't zoomed anymore, so they're readable on small screens (the browser version on itch). The","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:11:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029464","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:50:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4985040-1847286114029283","game_id":"steam-4985040","kind":"announcement","title":"Live: the AI crew builds SYMBIOSIS: CRITICALITY.","summary":"The crew’s mission control is live around the clock during Steam Next Fest. Watch my AI crew build SYMBIOSIS: CRITICALITY in real time: the build log, their chatter, the wishlist count and the game’s soundtrack, all on one screen. An incremental reactor physics simulator strategy game with high scores. The free demo is playable right now: build a reactor, teach it to run itself, and push it until it goes critical. I’m the solo dev making the calls. Say hi in chat!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:37:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029283","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:50:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4985040-1846651706693137","game_id":"steam-4985040","kind":"announcement","title":"Live: Symbiosis: Criticality demo, one bit to criticality","summary":"Live now: the free Symbiosis: Criticality demo, played start to finish. One core, one click, then drones, beams, ion arcs and a swarm you can still read. All the way until the reactor goes critical. The demo is free during Steam Next Fest. Grab it from the store page and play along.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T23:45:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693137","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4985040-1846651706693071","game_id":"steam-4985040","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 5.1.8.3: a cleaner run to criticality","summary":"STEAM EVENT (Steamworks > full game 4985040 > Community > Post/Manage Events & Announcements > Create New Event) Event type: \"Patch Notes\" (or \"Small Update / Patch Notes\") Cover image (800x450): event-cover-800x450.png Header image (1920x622): event-header-1920x622.png TITLE: Demo update 5.1.8.3: a cleaner run to criticality SUBTITLE: Steam Next Fest is live, and the demo just got smoother SUMMARY (one line): QUIT on the title screen, smoother tutorial cards, a clearer countdown and louder batt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T23:24:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4985040-1842846814454360","game_id":"steam-4985040","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo just grew up. New build is live.","summary":"The demo on Steam just got the biggest update it's ever had. It's the build we're taking into Steam Next Fest in October, and it's the first one that teaches the game instead of dropping you in it. What's new since the last build The crash course. Ten levels that teach the reactor by having you run it. Hit the core, catch what falls, buy your first machine, watch it start working without you. Every card tells you what to do and gets out of the way once you've done it. Prisons. When a boss dies, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T01:05:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454360","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4985040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:15Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:14Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4985040":"2026-10-26T05:55:15Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4985040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4985150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4985040","app_id":4985040,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:14Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/